  "title": "Fried Beef Ribs",
  "description": "Get your outdoor deep fryer ready for these fried beef ribs that are tender and juicy with a crispy, golden brown, perfectly seasoned breading.",
  "authors": [
    "JOHN MITSCHKE"
  ],
